  "unsupported": [
    "Headline face: Figma sets Bricolage Grotesque Heading SemiBold Condensed, the variable Google family at a condensed width. The font catalog has no axes for Bricolage, so a Google request drops the width; the fixture uploads the closest static cut instead (Bricolage Grotesque Headline SemiBold, opsz 56, wdth 79, wght 586, OFL).",
    "Mask offset: the mask sits inside larger image layers in Figma, but maskUrl stretches the mask over the field's own box and an image can't be offset inside its box, so image 9 is pre-cropped to the mask box (826 x 787 at 254, 482).",
    "Card stroke: 12px white OUTSIDE stroke in Figma; field strokes paint inside the box, so a larger white rect (558 x 395 at 57, 802, radius 37) sits behind the card.",
    "Hidden mask layers: place image here (a placeholder tile under a photo) and image 12 are fully covered by image 9 inside the mask, so they are left out.",
    "Logo: two vectors (the mark and the wordmark) exported as one SVG image; vector paths are not fields today."
  ],
